
simulator lang=spectre
include "/home/install/FOUNDRY/analog/180nm/models/spectre/gpdk.scs" section=NN
opt options soft_bin=allmodels save=allpub subcktprobelvl=2
Vdd (vdd 0) vsource dc=0.9
Vss (vss 0) vsource dc=-0.9
Vin_p (inp 0) vsource dc=0 mag=1
Vin_m (inm 0) vsource dc=0 mag=0

Ibias (vdd nbias) isource dc=30u
M8 (nbias nbias vss vss) nmos1 w=160u l=0.18u as=160u*0.36u ad=160u*0.36u ps=320u pd=320u
M5 (tail nbias vss vss) nmos1 w=160u l=0.18u as=160u*0.36u ad=160u*0.36u ps=320u pd=320u
M1 (net_m3 inm tail vss) nmos1 w=3.4u l=0.18u as=3.4u*0.36u ad=3.4u*0.36u ps=7u pd=7u
M2 (net_m4 inp tail vss) nmos1 w=3.4u l=0.18u as=3.4u*0.36u ad=3.4u*0.36u ps=7u pd=7u
M3 (net_m3 net_m3 vdd vdd) pmos1 w=10u l=0.18u as=10u*0.36u ad=10u*0.36u ps=20u pd=20u
M4 (net_m4 net_m3 vdd vdd) pmos1 w=10u l=0.18u as=10u*0.36u ad=10u*0.36u ps=20u pd=20u

M6 (vout net_m4 vdd vdd) pmos1 w=20u l=0.18u as=20u*0.36u ad=20u*0.36u ps=40u pd=40u
M7 (vout nbias vss vss) nmos1 w=160u l=0.18u as=160u*0.36u ad=160u*0.36u ps=320u pd=320u
Cc (net_m4 vout) capacitor c=1.0p
CL (vout 0) capacitor c=10p

dcOp dc
opInfo info what=oppoint where=rawfile
acSwp ac start=1 stop=100M dec=20
